-- הסכם קיבוצי (14.4.2016) — יישום רפורמת אופק חדש לגבי עובדי הוראה המשמשים
-- כמורי של"ח: the base agreement's promise to negotiate the reform for
-- further populations (its §155(ב)), kept for the civil service's של"ח
-- teachers. They are employed on Ofek Hadash terms — a junior-high
-- teacher's, with the changes this agreement makes: a week of 36 hours (23
-- frontal, 4 individual, 9 stay), five working days, the mother's,
-- post-maternity and age reductions, pay by the Ofek Hadash tables, placement,
-- promotion and conversion by the base agreement, the hour's value, the
-- determining salary for the budget pension, and a one-time grant of
-- 10,000 ₪ for תשע"ד–תשע"ה.
--
-- The base agreement is encoded section by section; where this agreement
-- applies one of its sections, it imports it (`base-agreement-<N>`), and the
-- completion agreement of 29.2.2012 for §24 as it amended it. The scan the
-- corpus is read from lacks two fax pages (§§17–23 and §§28–34, as the
-- corpus notes in place): what those sections say is not encoded, and a
-- clause that points into them (§8 to §31, §37 to §§32–34) answers that
-- the text is missing, naming the span (MMS-538), rather than an input that
-- would look like a value. The agreement of 13.1.1978, the pensions agreements of
-- 3.11.2011, 1.12.2013 and 9.11.2015 and the Pensions Law are not encoded
-- here either.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-25`
IMPORT `base-agreement-26`
IMPORT `base-agreement-38`
IMPORT `base-agreement-151`
IMPORT `base-agreement-159`
IMPORT `base-agreement-160`
IMPORT `2012-02-29_ofek-hadash_amendment_hascam-hashlama`
IMPORT vocabulary

§ `הסכם יישום רפורמת אופק חדש למורי של"ח — 14.4.2016`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The registration stamp under the Collective Agreements Law (19.07.2016, no. 100/2016); no rule.

-- The day of signing, written in by hand.
@ref akn:preamble/p3
`the signing of the של"ח agreement` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 14 4 2016

-- The parties: the State, by the Treasury's wages commissioner and the
-- Ministry of Education's director-general, and the teachers' union, by its
-- secretary-general.
@ref akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p7 akn:preamble/p8
`the של"ח agreement's parties` MEANS LIST `the State`, `the teachers' union`

-- akn:preamble/p6 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 "On the other side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 A recital: the reform agreements of 10.9.07 and 26.12.08, applied in the civil service's schools by תשע"ד; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p11 A recital: the base agreement (25.12.08) bound the parties to negotiate the reform for של"ח teachers; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p12 A recital: the State decided to apply the reform to them, with changes in their work; no rule.

-- The recital that frames §6: של"ח teachers are employed under the base
-- agreement as amended from time to time, and subject to this agreement.
@ref akn:preamble/p13
`a של"ח teacher's terms are the base agreement's as amended, subject to this agreement` MEANS TRUE

-- akn:preamble/p14 A recital: the reform changes their pay structure and raises it, the budget pension included; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p15 A recital: the determining salary for the budget pension is computed on two periods, before and from the move; §§28–34, which said how, are on pages the corpus lacks.
-- akn:preamble/p16 A recital: the parties anchor what they agreed in a collective agreement; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p17 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

§§ `א. כללי`

DECLARE `part of the של"ח agreement` IS ONE OF `its preamble`, `its body`, `one of its annexes`

@ref akn:art_1
GIVEN p IS A `part of the של"ח agreement`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `binds as the של"ח agreement` p IF
    TRUE

#ASSERT `binds as the של"ח agreement` `its preamble`

DECLARE `word form in the של"ח agreement` IS ONE OF `a masculine form`, `a feminine form`, `a singular form`, `a plural form`

@ref akn:art_2
GIVEN `written in` IS A `word form in the של"ח agreement`, `read in` IS A `word form in the של"ח agreement`, `expressly limited` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a word of the של"ח agreement reads in another form` `written in` `read in` `expressly limited` IF
    (NOT `expressly limited`) OR `written in` EQUALS `read in`

#ASSERT `a word of the של"ח agreement reads in another form` `a masculine form` `a plural form` FALSE

-- §3: the headings are for convenience and do not serve its reading.
@ref akn:art_3
GIVEN `the reading without the headings` IS A STRING, `the reading the headings suggest` IS A STRING
GIVETH A STRING
DECIDE `the reading the של"ח agreement takes` `the reading without the headings` `the reading the headings suggest` IS
    `the reading without the headings`

§§ `ב. תחולה, תחילה ותוקף`

-- §4: every employee in the civil service on the teaching employees' scale
-- employed in it as a של"ח teacher. ¶2: one also employed in the civil
-- service as a teaching employee otherwise is under this agreement only
-- for his של"ח share, and it applies in proportion to that share.
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_4/p2
GIVEN `in the civil service on the teaching employees' scale` IS A BOOLEAN, `share employed as a של"ח teacher` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `covered by the של"ח agreement` `in the civil service on the teaching employees' scale` `share employed as a של"ח teacher` IF
    `in the civil service on the teaching employees' scale` AND `share employed as a של"ח teacher` GREATER THAN 0

GIVEN `share employed as a של"ח teacher` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the share of the position the של"ח agreement applies to` `share employed as a של"ח teacher` IS
    `share employed as a של"ח teacher`

#ASSERT `the share of the position the של"ח agreement applies to` 0.6 EQUALS 0.6
#ASSERT NOT `covered by the של"ח agreement` TRUE 0

-- §5: where it applies another collective agreement, as amended from time
-- to time — so each import below is of the section as the corpus's later
-- instruments leave it.
@ref akn:art_5
`a collective agreement this agreement applies applies as amended` MEANS TRUE

§§ `ג. הגדרות`

-- akn:part_3/p1 The opening of the definitions ("בהסכם זה -"); the definition follows.

-- "מורה של"ח": a teacher employed by the Ministry and appointed as a של"ח
-- and ידיעת הארץ teacher, approved by the competent officers of the של"ח
-- division in the Ministry's society and youth administration, or by
-- another competent officer the Ministry names.
@ref akn:part_3/p2
GIVEN `employed by the Ministry of Education` IS A BOOLEAN
      `appointed as a של"ח and ידיעת הארץ teacher` IS A BOOLEAN
      `approved by the של"ח division or another officer the Ministry names` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a של"ח teacher` `employed by the Ministry of Education` `appointed as a של"ח and ידיעת הארץ teacher` `approved by the של"ח division or another officer the Ministry names` IF
        `employed by the Ministry of Education`
    AND `appointed as a של"ח and ידיעת הארץ teacher`
    AND `approved by the של"ח division or another officer the Ministry names`

#ASSERT NOT `a של"ח teacher` TRUE TRUE FALSE

§§ `ד. תנאי ההעסקה של מורי השל"ח`

-- akn:part_4 The heading of part ד, a word of which the corpus reads [לא קריא]; its clauses follow.

