-- teacher's terms, with the changes the circumstances need and subject to
-- this agreement.
@ref akn:art_6
GIVETH A `school stage`
DECIDE `the stage whose terms a של"ח teacher takes` IS
    `a junior high school`

-- §7: a non-academic של"ח teacher: chapters ט–י"ב of the base agreement,
-- with the changes needed, as amended (encoded in the base agreement's
-- sections of those chapters).
@ref akn:art_7
`the chapters of the base agreement a non-academic של"ח teacher takes` MEANS LIST "ט", "י", "י\"א", "י\"ב"

-- §8: an intern takes §31 of this agreement, which is on a page the corpus
-- lacks: what it says is not encoded.
