`the clause of the של"ח agreement an intern takes` MEANS "31"

@ref akn:art_8
`what the של"ח agreement gives an intern` MEANS
    `the text is missing` "§31 of the של\"ח agreement, on the fax pages with §§28–34"

-- §9: a של"ח teacher in a 100% position has a junior-high teacher's week,
-- by §17(א)–(ד) of the base agreement: (1) 36 hours; (2) 23 frontal hours
-- before a class, done by the Ministry's guidance, trips, field activities
-- and field days among them; (3) 4 hours with a group or one pupil, their
-- content set by the principal with the district של"ח supervisor; (4) the
-- rest, 9 stay hours, on the role's general tasks the Ministry sets.
@ref akn:art_9/p1 akn:art_9__para_1 akn:art_9__para_2 akn:art_9__para_3 akn:art_9__para_4
`a של"ח teacher's full week` MEANS `a week of` 23 4 9

#ASSERT `hours of the week` `a של"ח teacher's full week` EQUALS 36
#ASSERT `a של"ח teacher's full week` EQUALS `a junior-high teacher's full week`

`the content of a של"ח teacher's individual hours is set by` MEANS LIST `the school principal`, `the supervisor`

-- §10: the hours are done within the school's walls, save activity that is
-- by its nature outside the school and that the role needs (trips, field
-- activities, field days); hours that ask for a stay outside are done by
-- the Ministry's guidance and with the district של"ח supervisor's approval.
@ref akn:art_10
GIVEN `the activity is by its nature outside the school, as the role needs` IS A BOOLEAN
      `by the Ministry's guidance and approved by the district supervisor` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a של"ח teacher's hour may be done outside the school` `the activity is by its nature outside the school, as the role needs` `by the Ministry's guidance and approved by the district supervisor` IF
    `the activity is by its nature outside the school, as the role needs` AND `by the Ministry's guidance and approved by the district supervisor`

#ASSERT NOT `a של"ח teacher's hour may be done outside the school` TRUE FALSE

DECLARE `של"ח agreement action` IS ONE OF
    `prepare the field days`
    `pay for the field-day preparation by §4(ו) of the agreement of 13.1.1978`
    `impose further activities that need presence in the school, within the של"ח teacher's roles`
    `pay the one-time של"ח grant`

-- §11: nothing here takes from a של"ח teacher's existing duties (the
-- Ministry's directions, the collective agreements, the practice on the day
-- of signing). Among them he prepares the field days, by §3.א.(2) and
