`what the field-day preparation is paid` MEANS
    `the text is missing` "§4(ו) of the agreement of 13.1.1978: the corpus holds it without its words"

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `של"ח agreement action`
DECIDE `preparing the field days` IS
    PARTY `the teaching employee`
    MUST  `prepare the field days`
    HENCE (PARTY `the State`
           MUST  `pay for the field-day preparation by §4(ו) of the agreement of 13.1.1978`)

-- §12: the principal, or the district של"ח supervisor, may give the של"ח
-- teacher further activities that need presence in the school, within his
-- roles in the director-general's circulars, beyond the tasks of his stay
-- hours.
@ref akn:art_12
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `של"ח agreement action`
DECIDE `further activities by the principal` IS
    PARTY `the school principal`
    MAY   `impose further activities that need presence in the school, within the של"ח teacher's roles`

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `של"ח agreement action`
DECIDE `further activities by the district supervisor` IS
    PARTY `the supervisor`
    MAY   `impose further activities that need presence in the school, within the של"ח teacher's roles`

-- §13(א): in a full position, five working days a week, also in a school
-- of six. (ב): in a school of five days, one who worked four on the eve of
-- his move may go on with four, provided his day is not longer than 9 hours
-- in the school's timetable, the principal and the district supervisor
-- consent, and it fits the school's needs.
@ref akn:art_13__para_a
`working days a week of a של"ח teacher in a full position` MEANS 5

@ref akn:art_13__para_b
GIVEN `the school works five days a week` IS A BOOLEAN
      `worked four days a week on the eve of the move` IS A BOOLEAN
      `hours of his working day in the timetable` IS A NUMBER
      `the principal consents` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the district supervisor consents` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it fits the school's needs` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a של"ח teacher may go on working four days` `the school works five days a week` `worked four days a week on the eve of the move` `hours of his working day in the timetable` `the principal consents` `the district supervisor consents` `it fits the school's needs` IF
        `the school works five days a week`
    AND `worked four days a week on the eve of the move`
    AND `hours of his working day in the timetable` AT MOST 9
    AND `the principal consents`
    AND `the district supervisor consents`
    AND `it fits the school's needs`

#ASSERT `a של"ח teacher may go on working four days` TRUE TRUE 9 TRUE TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `a של"ח teacher may go on working four days` TRUE TRUE 9.5 TRUE TRUE TRUE

