GIVETH A `reduction after maternity leave`
DECIDE `a של"ח teacher's reduction after maternity leave` `position fraction` `months since the leave ended` IS
    `the reduction after maternity leave` `position fraction` `months since the leave ended`

#ASSERT `a של"ח teacher's reduction after maternity leave` 1 2 EQUALS `five stay hours a week for four months`

-- §16: the age hours of §26(א)–(ד); "existing teacher" and "new teacher"
-- are §7's.
@ref akn:art_16/p1
GIVEN h IS A `teacher's history`, `in a full position` IS A BOOLEAN, age IS A NUMBER
GIVETH AN `age reduction`
DECIDE `a של"ח teacher's age hours` h `in a full position` age IS
    `the age hours` (`an existing teacher` h) `in a full position` age

-- The pages the scan lacks, as the corpus marks them in place (here and
-- after §27), stated once (MMS-538): what they say is missing, not silent.
@ref akn:art_16/p2
`fax page 05` MEANS `the text is missing` "§§17–23 of the של\"ח agreement: fax page 05"

§§ `ח. החלת הוראות מהסכם אופק חדש`

-- §24(1): on entering the reform, paid by the updated tables of the
-- teaching employees on Ofek Hadash terms; (2) updated on the days and at
-- the rates of the cost-of-living increment. The tables are the base
-- agreement's and its amendments', an input here.
@ref akn:art_24__para_1 akn:art_24__para_2
GIVEN `the Ofek Hadash table pay at his grade and seniority` IS A NUMBER @desc from the updated tables of the teaching employees on Ofek Hadash terms
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a של"ח teacher's table pay` `the Ofek Hadash table pay at his grade and seniority` IS
    `the Ofek Hadash table pay at his grade and seniority`

`the של"ח tables are updated with the cost-of-living increment` MEANS TRUE

-- (3): placed by §36 of the base agreement as amended, with the changes
-- של"ח teachers need; a part-time של"ח teacher also employed in the civil
-- service in a further share is placed, as a של"ח teacher, at the grade set
-- for the further share.
@ref akn:art_24__para_3
GIVEN d IS A `highest degree`, `service seniority in teaching` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `placement`
DECIDE `a new academic של"ח teacher's placement` d `service seniority in teaching` IS
    `a new academic teacher's placement` d `service seniority in teaching`

GIVEN `grade by his own placement` IS A NUMBER, `grade set for his further share` IS A MAYBE NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a של"ח teacher's grade` `grade by his own placement` `grade set for his further share` IS
    CONSIDER `grade set for his further share`
    WHEN JUST g THEN g
    WHEN NOTHING THEN `grade by his own placement`

#ASSERT `a של"ח teacher's grade` 3 (JUST 5) EQUALS 5

-- (4): promoted by §§38 and 42 of the base agreement, every subsection;
-- (5): §§39 and 41 apply as the case may be (their rules are imported where
-- they are used).
@ref akn:art_24__para_4
GIVEN c IS A `candidate`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a של"ח teacher meets the conditions for the next grade` c IF
    `meets the conditions for the next grade` c

@ref akn:art_24__para_5
`the base agreement's sections a של"ח teacher's allowances follow` MEANS LIST "39", "41"

-- §25(1): an academic של"ח teacher's pay is converted by §§43–46 of the
-- base agreement; (2): for §44(ג), the conversion coefficient Y is the
-- junior-high one.
@ref akn:art_25__para_1 akn:art_25__para_2
-- The status is §7(יח)'s (the completion agreement's §5 adds it), the
-- four §44(ג) sets Y by.
DECLARE `a של"ח teacher's status for Y` IS ONE OF
    `a regular של"ח teacher`
    `a של"ח mother teacher`
    `a של"ח homeroom teacher`
    `a של"ח homeroom teacher and mother`

GIVEN st IS A `a של"ח teacher's status for Y`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a של"ח teacher's Y` st IS
    CONSIDER st
    WHEN `a regular של"ח teacher`             THEN `Y on a single base` `a regular teacher` `the junior-high base of 24 weekly hours`
    WHEN `a של"ח mother teacher`              THEN `Y on a single base` `a mother teacher` `the junior-high base of 24 weekly hours`
    WHEN `a של"ח homeroom teacher`            THEN `Y on a single base` `a homeroom teacher` `the junior-high base of 24 weekly hours`
    WHEN `a של"ח homeroom teacher and mother` THEN `Y on a single base` `a homeroom teacher and mother` `the junior-high base of 24 weekly hours`

GIVEN x IS A NUMBER, st IS A `a של"ח teacher's status for Y`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a של"ח teacher's converted pay` x st IS
    `A, the converted pay` x (`a של"ח teacher's Y` st)

#ASSERT map `a של"ח teacher's Y` (LIST `a regular של"ח teacher`, `a של"ח mother teacher`, `a של"ח homeroom teacher`, `a של"ח homeroom teacher and mother`) EQUALS LIST 27, 34, 30, 37
#ASSERT map (GIVEN st YIELD `Y on a single base` st `the junior-high base of 24 weekly hours`) `the statuses §7(יח) defines` EQUALS LIST 34, 30, 37, 27
#ASSERT `a של"ח teacher's converted pay` 7000 `a regular של"ח teacher` EQUALS 8890

§§ `ט. חישוב ערך שעה`

DECLARE `use of a של"ח teacher's hour value` IS ONE OF
    `a substitution hour, not in place of a stay hour, for a של"ח teacher`
    `another use of a של"ח teacher's hour value`

-- §26: the base of the hour's value for a של"ח teacher on Ofek Hadash
-- terms: (א) for a substitution hour, save one in place of a stay hour, the
-- components and rules that made the base on the eve of signing (an
-- input); (ב) for every other use — school activities, a deduction for
-- absence — the combined salary and the role allowances counted in the
-- salary that determines the pension, that he has in his regular pay.
@ref akn:art_26 akn:art_26__para_a akn:art_26__para_b
GIVEN u IS A `use of a של"ח teacher's hour value`
      `the base on the eve of signing` IS A NUMBER @desc the components and rules of the substitution hour's base before 14.4.2016
      p IS A `pay for the hour value`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the base of a של"ח teacher's hour value` u `the base on the eve of signing` p IS
    IF u EQUALS `a substitution hour, not in place of a stay hour, for a של"ח teacher`
    THEN `the base on the eve of signing`
    ELSE p's `combined salary` PLUS p's `pensionable role allowances`

-- §27: the hour's value is the base for a 100% position over 4.33 weeks
-- times 36 hours — §31(ב) of the base agreement. No rounding is stated
-- (convention rounding.default).
@ref akn:art_27 akn:art_27/p2 akn:art_27/p3
GIVEN u IS A `use of a של"ח teacher's hour value`, `the base on the eve of signing` IS A NUMBER, p IS A `pay for the hour value`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `a של"ח teacher's hour value` u `the base on the eve of signing` p IS
    `the hour value` (`the base of a של"ח teacher's hour value` u `the base on the eve of signing` p)

#ASSERT `a של"ח teacher's hour value` `another use of a של"ח teacher's hour value` 0 `a teacher for the hour value` EQUALS 55
#ASSERT `a של"ח teacher's hour value` `a substitution hour, not in place of a stay hour, for a של"ח teacher` 7794 `a teacher for the hour value` EQUALS 50

@ref akn:art_27/p4
`the fax pages with §§28–34` MEANS `the text is missing` "§§28–34 of the של\"ח agreement: the fax pages between scan pages 5 and 6"

`the spans the scan lacks` MEANS LIST `fax page 05`, `the fax pages with §§28–34`

