§§ `ח. תשלום מענק`

-- §39: with the salary of the month after signing (May 2016, paid on 1
-- June: convention dates.salary-month), a one-time grant of 10,000 ₪ to
-- the של"ח teachers employed on the day of signing who were employed in
-- the civil service in תשע"ד and תשע"ה, 1.9.2013–31.8.2015 ("התקופה").
@ref akn:art_39
`the של"ח grant for a full position` MEANS 10000
`the grant's period starts` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013
`the grant's period ends` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2015
`months in the grant's period` MEANS 24

GIVEN y IS A NUMBER, m IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the של"ח salary month` y m IS
    y TIMES 12 PLUS m

`the grant is paid with the salary of` MEANS `the של"ח salary month` 2016 5

-- F-ofek-hadash-shelach-2016-b: §39 asks that he was employed "בשנות
-- הלימודים תשע"ד ותשע"ה", and §41 pays one who was a של"ח teacher for part
-- of the period. The reading adopted (convention reading.consistent): §39
-- asks employment in the civil service at some time in the period, and §41
-- measures how much of it.
`the school years §39 names` MEANS LIST `the school year opening in` 2013, `the school year opening in` 2014

`§39 names both years where §41 pays for part of the period` MEANS
        count `the school years §39 names` EQUALS 2
    AND `the part of the grant's period he served` (`a של"ח teacher serving` (replicate 12 1)) EQUALS 0.5

GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `של"ח agreement action`
DECIDE `paying the של"ח grant` IS
    PARTY `the State`
    MUST  `pay the one-time של"ח grant`

@desc A של"ח teacher, as far as §§39–45 ask.
DECLARE `של"ח teacher for the grant` HAS
    `employed as a של"ח teacher on the day of signing` IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed in the civil service in the period` IS A BOOLEAN
    `of the period's months, those he was a של"ח teacher` IS A LIST OF NUMBER @desc his של"ח position share in each month he was a של"ח teacher in the period, paid absence counted (§44)

-- §40: the sum is for a full position as a של"ח teacher over the period;
-- part-time, the grant follows his weighted position share in the period,
-- 100% at most. §41: one who was a של"ח teacher for part of the period
-- gets the proportional part, by the part of the period he served.
-- F-ofek-hadash-shelach-2016-a: weighed over the whole period, with the
-- months he did not serve at nothing, §40 already takes the part of the
-- period, and §41 takes it again. The reading adopted (convention
-- reading.every-word): §40's share is weighed over the months he served as
-- a של"ח teacher, §41's part is those months over the period's 24 — an
-- exception to convention position.yearly, which counts a month not worked
-- at nothing.
GIVEN t IS A `של"ח teacher for the grant`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `his weighted של"ח position share in the months he served` t IS
    IF count (t's `of the period's months, those he was a של"ח teacher`) EQUALS 0
    THEN 0
    ELSE min 1 (sum (t's `of the period's months, those he was a של"ח teacher`) DIVIDED BY count (t's `of the period's months, those he was a של"ח teacher`))

GIVEN t IS A `של"ח teacher for the grant`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the part of the grant's period he served` t IS
    min 1 (count (t's `of the period's months, those he was a של"ח teacher`) DIVIDED BY `months in the grant's period`)

GIVEN t IS A `של"ח teacher for the grant`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the של"ח grant` t IS
    IF t's `employed as a של"ח teacher on the day of signing` AND t's `employed in the civil service in the period`
    THEN (`the של"ח grant for a full position` TIMES `his weighted של"ח position share in the months he served` t) TIMES `the part of the grant's period he served` t
    ELSE 0

@ref akn:art_40 akn:art_41
GIVEN months IS A LIST OF NUMBER
GIVETH A `של"ח teacher for the grant`
DECIDE `a של"ח teacher serving` months IS
    `של"ח teacher for the grant` WITH
        `employed as a של"ח teacher on the day of signing` IS TRUE
        `employed in the civil service in the period` IS TRUE
        `of the period's months, those he was a של"ח teacher` IS months

#ASSERT `the של"ח grant` (`a של"ח teacher serving` (replicate 24 1)) EQUALS 10000
#ASSERT `the של"ח grant` (`a של"ח teacher serving` (replicate 24 0.5)) EQUALS 5000
#ASSERT `the של"ח grant` (`a של"ח teacher serving` (replicate 12 1)) EQUALS 5000
-- At most 100%: a 120% share is a full one.
#ASSERT `the של"ח grant` (`a של"ח teacher serving` (replicate 24 1.2)) EQUALS 10000

-- F-ofek-hadash-shelach-2016-a's evidence: a full-time של"ח teacher of half
-- the period, his share weighed over the whole period (position.yearly's
-- month at nothing) and then cut again by §41, gets a quarter of the sum.
`§§40 and 41 read over the whole period take the part of the period twice` MEANS
        (`the של"ח grant for a full position` TIMES `the year's position share` (append (replicate 12 1) (replicate 12 0))) TIMES `the part of the grant's period he served` (`a של"ח teacher serving` (replicate 12 1)) EQUALS 2500
    AND `the של"ח grant` (`a של"ח teacher serving` (replicate 12 1)) EQUALS 5000
#ASSERT `§§40 and 41 read over the whole period take the part of the period twice`
#ASSERT `§39 names both years where §41 pays for part of the period`

-- §42: the grant is not salary for any purpose, and does not count for
-- severance pay (Severance Pay Law, 1963) or the hour's value. §43: no
-- provident, study, pension or other fund contribution on it. §45: it does
-- not count for the minimum-wage completion (Minimum Wage Law, 1987).
DECLARE `use of the של"ח grant` IS ONE OF
    `salary for any purpose`
    `severance pay`
    `the hour's value`
    `a provident-fund contribution`
    `the minimum-wage completion`

@ref akn:art_42 akn:art_43 akn:art_45
GIVEN u IS A `use of the של"ח grant`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the של"ח grant counts for` u IF
    FALSE

#ASSERT NOT `the של"ח grant counts for` `severance pay`

-- §44: paid also for absence for which the employer pays salary directly
-- (paid study leave, mourning, reserve duty, maternity leave) or sick pay
-- and the like; not for an unpaid absence.
DECLARE `absence in the grant's period` IS ONE OF
    `an absence the employer pays salary for`
    `an absence paid as sick pay or the like`
    `an unpaid absence`

@ref akn:art_44
GIVEN a IS AN `absence in the grant's period`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a month of the absence counts for the grant` a IF
    NOT a EQUALS `an unpaid absence`

#ASSERT `a month of the absence counts for the grant` `an absence paid as sick pay or the like`
#ASSERT NOT `a month of the absence counts for the grant` `an unpaid absence`

§§ `יב. יישוב חילוקי דעות`

-- The disputes mechanism of §§159 and 160 of the base agreement: a steering
-- committee and a supreme follow-up committee, set up as those sections
-- say (the opening word the corpus reads [לא קריא]); their members,
-- convening and deciding are those sections', imported.
@ref akn:part_8/p1
`the של"ח agreement's steering committee` MEANS `the steering committee's members`
`the של"ח agreement's supreme follow-up committee` MEANS `the supreme committee's members`

#ASSERT `the של"ח agreement's supreme follow-up committee` EQUALS LIST `the wages commissioner at the Treasury`, `the Ministry of Education`, `the teachers' union`

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 "In witness whereof the parties have signed"; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/p2 The signatures; no rule.
-- akn:conclusions/t1 The signature table (the government of Israel, the teachers' union); no rule.
